# mod-custom-spells: the Warlock spells of the concept revision of 2026-10-08
# (share-public custom-spells/09-concept-revision-20261008.md) on a bot - the
# changed 900800 (Paragon damage) and 900834 (Fel Vigor) and the new 900804,
# 900846, 900848, 900850, 900852, 900873, 900875. Every check states the
# revised line, so a FAIL marks a defect.
# Test ground: map 13, the FL dummy arena - eight AoE Training Dummies
# (920018: take 0 damage, never die, the combat log still reads the full
# amount; a dummy stays in combat 5 s after its last direct hit) on a 4-yd
# circle around (-270, 150), 3 health each. Slot 4 belongs to the cs_*
# scenarios; the cleanup unlearns every custom spell again. TBOT04's Paragon
# level is 1 (2026-10-08): "666 + 5 x Paragon level" = 671.
# The core's spell queue (SpellQueue.Enabled = 1): a bot's own, non-triggered
# cast inside the global cooldown fails with result 67 (NOT_READY), so each
# waits 1.6 s after the last one. Target counts read `maxtargets` (the units a
# cast picked): a missed unit is no damaged target (`targets`).
# Spells: Corruption 47813, Shadow Bolt 47809 (3-s cast), Metamorphosis 47241,
# Immolation Aura (demon) 50589 -> Immolation 50590 every 1 s, Hellfire 47823
# (channel, 15 s) -> Hellfire Effect 47822, Rain of Fire 47820 (channel, 8 s,
# aimed), Summon Imp 688 (NPC 416, Firebolt 47964: 2.5-s cast), Summon
# Voidwalker 697 (NPC 1860, Suffering rank 8 47990), Summon Felhunter 691 (NPC
# 417, Spell Lock 19647 -> silence 24259, Devour Magic 48011), Seduction 6358
# (humanoids only), Dismiss Pet 2641, Power Word: Fortitude 48161 (a magic buff
# for Devour Magic to take), Defias Thug 38 (level 3, humanoid, neutral),
# Combat Tester 11080 (level 60, hostile, 305,200 health, melee only, attacks
# only when attacked: the leech's target).
# Pets: a summoned demon is passive; a 300-ms run of the warlock_affliction
# rotation sends it at d1, the GM then makes it cast with ".cast target <spell>"
# (not "triggered": the GM's triggered cast ignores every effect).
name    Custom spells - Warlock revision 2026-10-08
timeout 360s

bot wl warlock slot=4

place 13 -279 150 -423.2 0
require wl alive
pick d1 creature:920018 near wl
require d1 exists
do gm target wl
as gm .unlearn 900800
as gm .unlearn 900801
as gm .unlearn 900802
as gm .unlearn 900804
as gm .unlearn 900833
as gm .unlearn 900834
as gm .unlearn 900835
as gm .unlearn 900836
as gm .unlearn 900837
as gm .unlearn 900838
as gm .unlearn 900839
as gm .unlearn 900840
as gm .unlearn 900846
as gm .unlearn 900848
as gm .unlearn 900850
as gm .unlearn 900852
as gm .unlearn 900866
as gm .unlearn 900867
as gm .unlearn 900868
as gm .unlearn 900869
as gm .unlearn 900870
as gm .unlearn 900873
as gm .unlearn 900875
as gm .unlearn 901101
as gm .unlearn 901102
as gm .unlearn 901103
as gm .unlearn 901104
as gm .unlearn 901111
as gm .unaura 47241
as gm .unaura 900805
as gm .unaura 900874
as gm .unaura 900876
do wl learn 47813
do wl learn 47809
do wl learn 688
do wl learn 697
do wl learn 691
do wl learn 47823
do wl learn 47820
do wl goto -263 150 -423.2
wait 500ms
pick de creature:920018 near wl
do wl goto -270 157 -423.2
wait 500ms
pick dn creature:920018 near wl
do wl goto -270 143 -423.2
wait 500ms
pick ds creature:920018 near wl
do wl goto -264 155 -423.2
wait 500ms
pick dne creature:920018 near wl
do wl goto -279 150 -423.2
wait 500ms
do wl approach d1
wait 500ms

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Affliction
log Affliction - 900800 Shadow Eruption, its helper row: 900803 deals 666 Shadow without a die and cannot miss - aimed at d1 it hits all 8 dummies for 5,328 (a crit adds 333; the old row's 801-1,000 a hit came to at least 6,408)
spelllog start
do wl cast 900803 at d1 triggered
wait 1s
spelllog stop
expect wl spell 900803 hits == 8
expect wl spell 900803 damage >= 5328
expect wl spell 900803 damage <= 6327

log Affliction - 900800 CONCEPT "dmg dependent on paragon lvl": a DoT tick's eruption (20 %, 2 s ICD) hits the 7 other dummies for 666 + 5 x Paragon level each - the window closes on the first eruption: 7 hits, 4,662-5,600 (Paragon 1-18, crits included; 801-1,000 a hit would be 5,607 or more)
do wl learn 900800
do wl goto -293 150 -423.2
wait 500ms
do wl reset
spelllog start
do wl cast 47813 on d1
wait 1600ms
do wl cast 47813 on dn
wait 1600ms
do wl cast 47813 on ds
wait 1600ms
do wl cast 47813 on de
wait 1600ms
do wl cast 47813 on dne
waitfor wl spell 900803 casts >= 1 timeout 40s
spelllog stop
expect wl spell 900803 casts == 1
expect wl spell 900803 hits == 7
expect wl spell 900803 damage >= 4662
expect wl spell 900803 damage <= 5600
as gm .unlearn 900800

log Affliction - 900804 CONCEPT Withering Harvest: every DoT tick adds a stack of 900805 (+1 % damage-over-time damage each, 30 s) - a fresh Corruption on d1 ticks every 3 s (first the global cooldown of the last Corruption runs out: a cast inside it fails with result 67, NOT_READY)
do wl learn 900804
wait 1600ms
do wl cast 47813 on d1
wait 7s
expect wl aurastacks 900805 >= 2
expect wl spellmod 47813 dot 100 >= 102

log Affliction - 900804 CONCEPT at 100 stacks: every 5 sec a free Drain Life (900806: a leech, 133 a second for 5 s) on a random enemy in combat within 30 yd - an aura on the enemy, no channel: the warlock's own Shadow Bolt (3-s cast) goes on meanwhile. The enemy is a Combat Tester (11080: level 60, hostile, 305,200 health - no window can kill it -, melee only, no spells, a civilian: it fights only when attacked, so neither the GM nor the warlock draws it) 75 yd north of the ring, no dummy within 30 yd, put in combat by a triggered Shadow Bolt (a triggered hit engages, as the Hellfire Effect showed in bot run 478) and fighting the warlock; the warlock 3000 health down for the leech to fill. Not a dummy: the core caps a leech tick at the target's health and heals by the damage dealt - on a dummy (3 health, takes no damage) 3 a tick and no heal (bot run 478). A leech tick is a damage line, not a periodic one: hits and damage count, ticks stay 0
as gm .aura stack 900805 99
expect wl aurastacks 900805 == 100
do wl goto -270 228 -422.72
do gm goto -270 230 -422.72
wait 500ms
as gm .npc add temp 11080
do gm goto -279 150 -423.2
wait 300ms
pick ct creature:11080 near wl
require ct exists
do wl approach ct 3
do wl cast 47809 on ct triggered
waitfor ct victim wl timeout 5s
wait 300ms
as gm .damage 3000
spelllog start
do wl cast 47809 on ct
wait 11s
spelllog stop
expect wl spell 900806 casts >= 1
expect wl spell 900806 damage >= 600
expect wl spell 900806 heal >= 600
expect wl spell 47809 casts >= 1
do gm target ct
as gm .die
do gm target wl
as gm .unlearn 900804
as gm .unaura 900805
do wl reset

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Demonology
log Demonology - 900834 CONCEPT Fel Vigor: during Metamorphosis the Immolation Aura (50589 -> 50590 each second) heals the warlock for all the damage it deals (one heal a tick, logged as 900834) - in the ring's middle, 3000 health down first
do wl learn 900834
do wl goto -270 150 -423.2
wait 500ms
as gm .damage 3000
do wl cast 47241 triggered
wait 300ms
spelllog start
do wl cast 50589 triggered
wait 3500ms
spelllog stop
expect wl spell 50590 maxtargets >= 7
expect wl spell 900834 hits >= 2
expect wl spell 900834 heal >= 1000

log Demonology - 900834 CONCEPT "your demon get +100% damage" in demon form: the Imp carries Fel Fury (900845, +100 % damage done) while Metamorphosis lasts, and loses it with Metamorphosis
do wl cast 688 triggered
wait 1s
pick imp creature:416 near wl
expect imp exists
waitfor imp aura 900845 timeout 3s
as gm .unaura 47241
waitfor imp noaura 900845 timeout 3s
as gm .unlearn 900834

log Demonology - 900846 CONCEPT "imp: his firebolt attacks 50% faster": the Imp carries Quickened Firebolt (900847, casting speed +50 %), Firebolt's 2.5-s cast takes 1.67 s - a Firebolt on command completes within 1.9 s with it and never without it
do wl goto -279 150 -423.2
wait 500ms
do wl rotation warlock_affliction on d1 for 300ms
wait 500ms
do wl stop
wait 3s
do gm target imp
spelllog start
as gm .cast target 47964
wait 1900ms
spelllog stop
expect wl spell 47964 casts == 0
do gm target wl
do wl learn 900846
waitfor imp aura 900847 timeout 3s
wait 3s
do gm target imp
spelllog start
as gm .cast target 47964
wait 1900ms
spelllog stop
expect wl spell 47964 casts >= 1
do gm target wl
as gm .unlearn 900846
waitfor imp noaura 900847 timeout 3s

log Demonology - 900848 CONCEPT "voidwalker: +500% hp and passive cast his aoe taunt every 10 sec in combat": Void Bulwark (900849) on the Voidwalker - six times its health (TBOT04's: 6,154 -> 36,924, bot run 478) - and Suffering (47990, rank 8) every 10 s while it fights d1 (the rotation leaves the warlock 30 yd from d1: the Voidwalker walks there first)
do wl cast 697 triggered
wait 1s
pick vw creature:1860 near wl
expect vw exists
expect vw maxhealth < 7000
do wl learn 900848
waitfor vw aura 900849 timeout 3s
expect vw maxhealth >= 35000
do wl rotation warlock_affliction on d1 for 300ms
wait 500ms
do wl stop
waitfor vw incombat timeout 10s
spelllog start
wait 21s
spelllog stop
expect wl spell 47990 casts >= 2
as gm .unlearn 900848
waitfor vw noaura 900849 timeout 3s

log Demonology - 900850 CONCEPT "succubus: charm now hits +9 targets and their damage take is increased by 25% for 30seconds (stacks 4 times)": Seduction (6358) jumps to 9 more enemies (jump targets 0 -> 10) and every unit it lands on gets a stack of Seductive Torment (900851) - five Defias Thugs (humanoids) 20 yd north-west of the ring, the warlock's own Seduction (a succubus casts with its owner's modifiers, as Demonic Power shows)
do wl learn 900850
expect wl spellmod 6358 jumptargets 0 == 10
do gm goto -290 165 -423.2
wait 500ms
as gm .npc add temp 38
as gm .npc add temp 38
as gm .npc add temp 38
as gm .npc add temp 38
as gm .npc add temp 38
do gm goto -279 150 -423.2
wait 1s
pick k1 creature:38 near wl
require k1 exists
do wl goto -290 158 -423.2
wait 500ms
spelllog start
do wl cast 6358 on k1 triggered
wait 1s
spelllog stop
expect wl spell 6358 maxtargets >= 5
expect k1 aurastacks 900851 == 1
expect k1 auraduration 900851 > 25000
do wl cast 6358 on k1 triggered
wait 500ms
expect k1 aurastacks 900851 == 2
log Demonology - the thugs die to a Hellfire Effect next to them (no thug left)
do wl goto -290 163 -423.2
wait 500ms
do wl cast 47822 triggered
wait 1500ms
do wl cast 47822 triggered
wait 1500ms
expect creature:38 missing
do wl stop
as gm .unlearn 900850

log Demonology - 900852 CONCEPT "Spell Lock is aoe now, Devour Magic also": the Felhunter's Spell Lock (19647) on d1 is cast again, triggered, on every other enemy within 10 yd of d1 (8 casts; one without the passive - each spell once, their cooldowns forbid a second command); so is Devour Magic (48011) - Power Word: Fortitude on d1, dn and ds for it to take
do wl goto -279 150 -423.2
wait 500ms
do wl cast 691 triggered
wait 1s
pick fh creature:417 near wl
expect fh exists
do wl rotation warlock_affliction on d1 for 300ms
wait 500ms
do wl stop
wait 1s
do wl learn 900852
do gm target fh
spelllog start
as gm .cast target 19647
wait 1s
spelllog stop
expect wl spell 19647 casts >= 7
do gm target d1
as gm .aura 48161
do gm target dn
as gm .aura 48161
do gm target ds
as gm .aura 48161
waitfor ds aura 48161 timeout 2s
do gm target fh
spelllog start
as gm .cast target 48011
wait 1s
spelllog stop
expect wl spell 48011 casts >= 7
do gm target wl
as gm .unlearn 900852
do wl cast 2641 triggered

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Destruction
log Destruction - control: without 900873 Hellfire (47823) is a channel
do wl goto -270 150 -423.2
wait 500ms
do wl reset
do wl cast 47823
wait 500ms
expect wl casting 47823
do wl stop
wait 300ms
expect wl notcasting

log Destruction - 900873 CONCEPT "you can now move while using hellfire": with it a Hellfire cast is no channel - the warlock carries the ticker 900874 for the 15 s; each second Hellfire Effect (47822) strikes every enemy within 10 yd of where he stands now and he burns himself (47823); 25 yd away the ring takes nothing (the control's global cooldown runs out first; the target counts are the units each cast picked - a miss damages nobody)
do wl learn 900873
do wl reset
wait 1600ms
do wl cast 47823
wait 500ms
expect wl notcasting
expect wl aura 900874
expect wl auraduration 900874 > 13000
spelllog start
wait 2500ms
spelllog stop
expect wl spell 47822 casts >= 2
expect wl spell 47822 maxtargets >= 7
expect wl spell 47823 hits >= 2
do wl goto -295 150 -423.2
wait 300ms
spelllog start
wait 2500ms
spelllog stop
expect wl spell 47822 casts >= 2
expect wl spell 47822 maxtargets == 0
as gm .unaura 900874
as gm .unlearn 900873

log Destruction - 900875 CONCEPT "rain of fire is around you for its duration instead on target ground and dont need a channel anymore": a Rain of Fire (47820) aimed 20 yd west of the ring is no channel - ticker 900876 (8 s) rains every 2 s round the warlock in the ring's middle (900877: every enemy within 8 yd)
do wl learn 900875
do wl goto -270 150 -423.2
wait 500ms
do wl reset
do wl cast 47820 at -290 150 -423.2
wait 500ms
expect wl notcasting
expect wl aura 900876
spelllog start
wait 4500ms
spelllog stop
expect wl spell 900877 casts >= 2
expect wl spell 900877 maxtargets >= 7
as gm .unaura 900876
as gm .unlearn 900875

cleanup
do wl stop
do gm target d1
as gm .unaura 48161
do gm target dn
as gm .unaura 48161
do gm target ds
as gm .unaura 48161
do gm target wl
as gm .unlearn 900800
as gm .unlearn 900801
as gm .unlearn 900802
as gm .unlearn 900804
as gm .unlearn 900833
as gm .unlearn 900834
as gm .unlearn 900835
as gm .unlearn 900836
as gm .unlearn 900837
as gm .unlearn 900838
as gm .unlearn 900839
as gm .unlearn 900840
as gm .unlearn 900846
as gm .unlearn 900848
as gm .unlearn 900850
as gm .unlearn 900852
as gm .unlearn 900866
as gm .unlearn 900867
as gm .unlearn 900868
as gm .unlearn 900869
as gm .unlearn 900870
as gm .unlearn 900873
as gm .unlearn 900875
as gm .unlearn 901101
as gm .unlearn 901102
as gm .unlearn 901103
as gm .unlearn 901104
as gm .unlearn 901111
as gm .unaura 47241
as gm .unaura 900805
as gm .unaura 900874
as gm .unaura 900876
as gm .unaura 47823
as gm .unaura 47893
do wl goto -290 163 -423.2
wait 300ms
do wl cast 47822 triggered
wait 500ms
do wl cast 688 triggered
wait 500ms
do wl cast 2641 triggered
do wl goto -279 150 -423.2
